Typically, I query the Rodney bot in #nethack for my playstyle
weaknesses:
* What percentage of my games ended on a trap (or impared due to a
trap)?
* ... due to lack of reflection? Should I rather do Sokoban or care
about foodless nutrition?
* ... due to loss of conduct?
* ... before I got to the Oracle? Does starting with a drum/horn help
much?
* ... other causes? Have I improved over time?
* How much realtime do I invest per match and game stage (Oracle,
Sokoban, Mine town, get a polytap, throne farming)?
* Is the competition ahead of me?

All those queries exclude startscumming. I'm doing 12-conduct
attempts, that is breaking no officially tracked conduct.

Some typical !lg queries that implement such questions:

!lg name=~tjr3|tjr4|tjr5|tjr nconducts=12 birthdate>=20100901 turns>20
gmax=role #count attempts

!lg name=~tjr3|tjr4|tjr5|tjr nconducts<12 birthdate>=20100901
turns>200 killer=quit gmax=role #count loss of conduct

!lg name=~tjr3|tjr4|tjr5|tjr nconducts=12 birthdate>=20100901 turns>20
gmax=role maxlevel>=5 maxHP>=21 #count post-Oracle

!lg name=~tjr3|tjr4|tjr5|tjr nconducts=12 birthdate>=20100901 turns>20
gmax=role maxlevel>=5 maxHP>=21 killer~=*fire*|*lightning*|*bolt*cold*|
*blast*|*disintegrat*|*death* #count post-Oracle reflection deaths

!lg name=~tjr3|tjr4|tjr5|tjr nconducts=12 birthdate>=20100901 turns>20
maxlevel>=2 gmax=killer killer hide=score #analyze deaths

!lg * nconducts=12 birthdate>=20100901 turns>20 maxlevel>=5 maxHP>=21
gmax=name #monitor the competition



